@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia — HL7 FHIR R4 Emission + Gateway

actor Usuario
participant "HL7Application\n(ComboBox + TextArea)" as App
participant "HL7Emitter" as Emitter
participant "TokenProvider" as Token
participant "ValidationOracle" as Val
participant "HAPI Backend\n(localhost:8099)" as HAPI
participant "Keycloak\n(localhost:9080)" as KC
participant "FHIR Gateway\n(localhost:8080)" as GW

== Inicio ==

Usuario -> App: Selecciona paciente en ComboBox
App -> Emitter: setSelectedPatientMRN(mrn)

Usuario -> App: Click "Start"
App -> Emitter: start(host, port, FHIR_R4, interval)
Emitter -> Emitter: Crear backendClient\n(HAPI FHIR, 8099, sin auth)
Emitter -> Emitter: Crear gatewayClient\n(FHIR Gateway, 8080)
Emitter -> Emitter: Crear TokenProvider\n(Keycloak, 9080)
Emitter -> Token: fetchBearerToken()
Token -> KC: POST /token\n(grant_type=password)
KC --> Token: access_token (5 min TTL)
Token -> Token: tokenCache = token
Emitter -> Emitter: Schedule emit task

== Ciclo de emisión ==

loop Cada intervalo

  Emitter -> Val: getRecentUpdates()
  Val --> Emitter: recentUpdates

  loop Para cada validación en recentUpdates

    Emitter -> Emitter: fhirObservation()

    alt selectedPatientMRN != null
      Emitter -> Emitter: MRN = selectedPatientMRN
    else fallback DDS
      Emitter -> Emitter: MRN = deviceUdiToPatientMRN\n(legacy map)
    end

    alt MRN == null
      Emitter -> Emitter: crear Obs sin subject\n(solo display en consola)
    else MRN != null

      Emitter -> HAPI: GET /Patient?identifier=<system>|<MRN>

      alt Paciente existe en HAPI
        HAPI --> Emitter: Patient/<id>
      else Paciente NO existe
        HAPI --> Emitter: 404 Not Found

        Emitter -> HAPI: PUT /Patient/<uuid>\n(conditional create)
        Note right: Patient con identifier:\nsystem = urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.3.1974\nvalue = MRN
        HAPI --> Emitter: Patient/<newId>

        Emitter -> Emitter: addToAuthorizedList(patientId)

        Emitter -> HAPI: GET /List/patient-list-example
        HAPI --> Emitter: ListResource

        alt Patient YA está en la lista
          Emitter -> Emitter: log("ya está en la lista")
        else Patient NO está en la lista
          Emitter -> HAPI: PUT /List/patient-list-example\n(agregar entry con item=Patient/<id>)
          HAPI --> Emitter: 200 OK
          Emitter -> Emitter: log("agregado a la lista")
        end

      end

      Emitter -> HAPI: GET /Device?<udi>
      alt Device existe
        HAPI --> Emitter: Device/<id>
      else Device NO existe
        Emitter -> HAPI: POST /Device
        Note right: Device escrito directo al backend\n(no pasa por gateway — no está\nen patient compartment)
        HAPI --> Emitter: Device/<newId>
      end

      Emitter -> Emitter: Obs.setSubject(PatientRef)\nObs.setDevice(DeviceRef)\nObs.setCode(metric)\nObs.setValue(Quantity)
      Emitter -> Emitter: bundle.addEntry(obs)

    end

  end

  Emitter -> Emitter: sendObservations()

  Emitter -> Emitter: Construir Transaction Bundle
  Note right: Bundle con type = transaction\nentries = Observations listas

  Emitter -> Token: fetchBearerToken()

  alt tokenCache vencido (< 10s TTL)
    Token -> KC: POST /token\n(grant_type=password)
    KC --> Token: nuevo access_token
    Token -> Token: tokenCache = token
  end

  Token --> Emitter: token

  Emitter -> GW: POST /\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\nContent-Type: application/json\n{ Transaction Bundle }

  GW -> GW: Validar bearer token\n(Keycloak introspection)

  alt Token inválido
    GW --> Emitter: 401 Unauthorized
    Emitter -> Emitter: log("Unauthorized")
  else Token válido
    GW -> GW: Para cada Observation en bundle:

    alt Observation tiene subject
      GW -> GW: PatientRef = obs.subject.reference

      GW -> HAPI: GET /List?_id=patient-list-example\n&_elements=id&item=<PatientRef>

      alt Patient está en authorized list
        GW -> HAPI: POST /Observation\n(gateway → backend)
        HAPI --> GW: 201 Created
        GW --> Emitter: 200 OK\n(entry results)
      else Patient NO está en authorized list
        GW --> Emitter: 403 Forbidden\n"User is not authorized"\n"Reference Patients not in List!"
        Note right: ListAccessChecker\nrechaza la escritura
      end

    else Observation NO tiene subject
      GW --> Emitter: 400 Bad Request\n"Missing Subject"
      Note right: PatientFinderImp\nrequiere subject
    end

  end

  Emitter -> Emitter: log("Response: " + status)

  Emitter -> App: newLine(jsonStrings)
  Note right: Siempre muestra en consola\n(since sendObservations display=always)

  App -> App: TextArea.appendText(jsonStrings)

end

== Detención ==

Usuario -> App: Click "Stop"
App -> Emitter: stop()
Emitter -> Emitter: cancel(emit task)
Emitter -> Emitter: close(clients)
Emitter --> App: stopped()
App -> App: Botón Start habilitado\nStop deshabilitado

@enduml
